Commercial license terms, including fees, scope, duration, and permitted use, will be set out in a separate written agreement between the Business and the Licensor.

The parties may also agree separately on additional development, custom features, support, consulting, maintenance, or other services. Such services are not included in this license unless a separate written agreement says they are.

